  "{scale} µm per px, saved with the workspace": "1 px あたり {scale} µm（ワークスペースに保存済み）",
  "; the beads read {ratio}× longer one way than the other, so one image axis is off by about that much": "。ビーズは一方向に {ratio} 倍長く見えるので、画像の一方の軸がおよそその分ずれています",
  "Measuring {file} ({index} of {count})… {percent}%": "{file} を測定中（{count} 件中 {index} 件目）… {percent}%",
